     "h": 537,
     "title": "Fully automated with »tribos«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Fully automated with »tribos«</h3> <p>The SCHUNK TRIBOS clamping unit is automatically moved to the clamping position and returned to the starting position at the end of the clamping/unclamping process.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/8/csm_tribos_pilot_11cbe8523d.webp",
     "alt": "",
