     "title": "Safely supported by »pilot«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Safely supported by »pilot«</h3> <p>The optimum interaction between the »pilot« image processing software and the TRIBOS clamping unit controller from Schunk ensures that the tool length is set with μm accuracy.</p> </figcaption>"
